Error [jet.DefaultReadsLaterParameter]: Default for `a` in `f` references `b`, which comes after it
  --> tests/ui/default_forward_ref.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | f: fn(a: Int{b}, b: Int) -> Int { a }
    |              ^
 Why: Defaults fill left to right; a parameter isn't in scope until it appears in the list
 Fix: Reorder the parameters so `b` comes before `a`, or use a constant default
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0126

Error [jet.MissingArgument]: This call to `f` is missing `b`
  --> tests/ui/default_forward_ref.jet:3:8
    |
  3 |     _: f(1)
    |        ^
 Why: `b` has no default, so every call has to supply it
 Fix: Add `b: …` to the call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0766
